You and me

2023
01:38:54,590 --> 01:38:57,351
In this
collision of worlds

2024
01:38:59,073 --> 01:39:01,314
Watch the
new day dawn o

2025
01:39:01,314 --> 01:39:03,594
n a distant shore

2026
01:39:03,715 --> 01:39:06,636
In this
collision of worlds

2027
01:39:08,397 --> 01:39:08,798
Oh

2028
01:39:08,838 --> 01:39:12,759
you can't sit
this out no more

2029
01:39:13,800 --> 01:39:14,560
Albey Road

2030
01:39:14,600 --> 01:39:16,840
Route 66，CIA

2031
01:39:16,880 --> 01:39:18,320
To the MI6

2032
01:39:18,360 --> 01:39:18,880
Right lane

2033
01:39:18,920 --> 01:39:19,960
